{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Your next case, Mr Investigator. That's what she calls you.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's business as usual, another misfortune filed at our doorstep. The only difference this time is our client is very particular about this job and left a note for you to read.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you want my advice, just do what you do. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mr Investigator.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detective Work With The Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mr Investigator</i> is a first-person murder investigation based on evidence analysis and logical deduction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the timeline\u00a0before their death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investigate the  days prior to the killing. Use your detective intuition to piece together the truth behind the murder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gain insight with each question asked.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross examine evidence and clues inside the simulated memories.\u00a0Restore the remaining pages of her father's diary.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816830?t=1764788756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816830?t=1764788756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/b070f2c1f56acde319d8426616357e24fc4d512f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764788756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/b070f2c1f56acde319d8426616357e24fc4d512f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764788756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game demo explores themes of significant personal loss and intense grief that some may find distressing."},"demos":[{"appid":4130380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Your next case, Mr Investigator. That's what she calls you.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's business as usual, another misfortune filed at our doorstep. The only difference this time is our client is very particular about this job and left a note for you to read.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you want my advice, just do what you do. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mr Investigator.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detective Work With The Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mr Investigator</i> is a first-person murder investigation based on evidence analysis and logical deduction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the timeline\u00a0before their death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investigate the  days prior to the killing. Use your detective intuition to piece together the truth behind the murder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gain insight with each question asked.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross examine evidence and clues inside the simulated memories.\u00a0Restore the remaining pages of her father's diary.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Haoning Wu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/0b617a508823115aa2f3e8af1a66ef222b804572/header.jpg?t=1764788756","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816830/1170555499/6eb5c0f28e57e04b3917d975d78495543cba3513/1761157401/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762892001","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai